  soulName: Elias Vorn
  age: 52
  causeOfDeath: "Fabrika yang\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131nda ezilme ve dumandan
    bo\u011Fulma"
  introDialogueSegments:
  - "Ben sadece d\xFCzeni korumaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yordum"
  - "\u0130nsanlar panikledi\u011Finde herkes birbirini ezer. Birinin kontrol\xFC
    eline almas\u0131 gerekir"
  - "O acil \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F kap\u0131s\u0131 \xE7\xF6kecek gibiydi. Herkesi
    oraya y\xF6nlendiremezdim."
  - "Ben hayatta kald\u0131m diye su\xE7lu oldum"
  - "\xC7irkin bir karar verdim belki\u2026 ama gerekliydi"
  fileSummary: "Elias Vorn, Ardent Tekstil\u2019de vardiya sorumlusu olarak \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yordu.
    Fabrika yang\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131nda \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar\u0131 yan
    acil \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Ftan uzakla\u015Ft\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131 ve bu
    karar\u0131n baz\u0131 ki\u015Filerin i\xE7eride mahsur kalmas\u0131na yol a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131
    rapor edildi. Tan\u0131k ifadeleri, Elias\u2019\u0131n insanlar\u0131 korumaya
    m\u0131 \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131 yoksa \xF6nce kendi hayat\u0131n\u0131
    m\u0131 kurtard\u0131\u011F\u0131 konusunda \xE7eli\u015Fmektedir."
